<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Rate Agreement</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right;">
    <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: left;">
    <span data-field="ein">{{ ein }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES RATE AGREEMENT</div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">ORGANIZATION:</div>
    <div style="font-weight: bold;">AGREEMENT DATE:</div>
    <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="agreement_date">{{ agreement_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="font-weight: bold;">SECTION I: INDIRECT COST RATES</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>RATE TYPES:</th>
        <th>FIXED</th>
        <th>FINAL</th>
        <th>PROV. (PROVISIONAL)</th>
        <th>PRED. (PREDETERMINED)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in indirect_cost_rates %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].rate_type">{{ indirect_cost_rates[loop.index0].rate_type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].fixed">{{ indirect_cost_rates[loop.index0].fixed }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].final">{{ indirect_cost_rates[loop.index0].final }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].prov">{{ indirect_cost_rates[loop.index0].prov }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].pred">{{ indirect_cost_rates[loop.index0].pred }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
    <span data-field="effective_period">{{ effective_period }}</span>
  </div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>TYPE</th>
        <th>FROM</th>
        <th>TO</th>
        <th>RATE (%)</th>
        <th>LOCATION</th>
        <th>APPLICABLE TO</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in indirect_cost_rates_table %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates_table[{{ loop.index0 }}].type">{{ indirect_cost_rates_table[loop.index0].type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates_table[{{ loop.index0 }}].from">{{ indirect_cost_rates_table[loop.index0].from }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates_table[{{ loop.index0 }}].to">{{ indirect_cost_rates_table[loop.index0].to }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates_table[{{ loop.index0 }}].rate">{{ indirect_cost_rates_table[loop.index0].rate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates_table[{{ loop.index0 }}].location">{{ indirect_cost_rates_table[loop.index0].location }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="indirect_cost_rates_table[{{ loop.index0 }}].applicable_to">{{ indirect_cost_rates_table[loop.index0].applicable_to }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="font-weight: bold;">*BASE</div>
  <p>
    Modified total direct costs, consisting of all direct salaries and wages, applicable fringe benefits, materials and supplies, services, travel and up to the first <span data-field="base_threshold">{{ base_threshold }}</span> of each subaward (regardless of the period of performance of the subaward under the award). Modified total direct costs shall exclude equipment, capital expenditures, charges for patient care, rental costs, tuition remission, scholarships and fellowships, participant support costs and the portion of each subaward in excess of <span data-field="excess_threshold">{{ excess_threshold }}</span>. Other items may only be excluded when necessary to avoid a serious inequity in the distribution of indirect costs, and with the approval of the cognizant agency for indirect costs.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="font-weight: bold;">SECTION I: FRINGE BENEFIT RATES**</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>TYPE</th>
        <th>FROM</th>
        <th>TO</th>
        <th>RATE (%)</th>
        <th>LOCATION</th>
        <th>APPLICABLE TO</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in fringe_benefit_rates %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="fringe_benefit_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].type">{{ fringe_benefit_rates[loop.index0].type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fringe_benefit_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].from">{{ fringe_benefit_rates[loop.index0].from }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fringe_benefit_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].to">{{ fringe_benefit_rates[loop.index0].to }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fringe_benefit_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].rate">{{ fringe_benefit_rates[loop.index0].rate }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fringe_benefit_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].location">{{ fringe_benefit_rates[loop.index0].location }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fringe_benefit_rates[{{ loop.index0 }}].applicable_to">{{ fringe_benefit_rates[loop.index0].applicable_to }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <span data-field="fringe_benefit_description">{{ fringe_benefit_description }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="font-weight: bold;">SECTION II: SPECIAL REMARKS</div>
  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>
      Treatment of Fringe Benefits:
      <span data-field="fringe_benefits_remark">{{ fringe_benefits_remark }}</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      Treatment of Paid Absences:
      <span data-field="paid_absences_remark">{{ paid_absences_remark }}</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      Off-Campus Definition:
      <span data-field="off_campus_definition">{{ off_campus_definition }}</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      Fringe Benefits Include:
      <span data-field="fringe_benefits_included">{{ fringe_benefits_included }}</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      The Rates Issued in this Agreement are also applicable to <span data-field="applicable_institution">{{ applicable_institution }}</span>.
    </p>
    <p>
      NOTE: <span data-field="note_details">{{ note_details }}</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      *The Facilities and Administrative rate proposal, based on the fiscal year ending <span data-field="fa_rate_end_date">{{ fa_rate_end_date }}</span>, is due in our office by <span data-field="fa_rate_due_date">{{ fa_rate_due_date }}</span>.
    </p>
    <p>
      *The next Fringe Benefit rate proposal, based on actual costs for the fiscal year ending <span data-field="fringe_rate_end_date">{{ fringe_rate_end_date }}</span>, is due in our office by <span data-field="fringe_rate_due_date">{{ fringe_rate_due_date }}</span>.
    </p>
    <p>
      This agreement updates the Fringe Benefit rates section only. Highly Compensated Employees were combined with Full-Time Employees beginning <span data-field="hce_start_date">{{ hce_start_date }}</span>. All other terms and conditions remain unchanged.
    </p>
    <p>
      Equipment means tangible personal property (including information technology systems) having a useful life of more than one year and a per-unit acquisition cost which equals or exceeds <span data-field="equipment_threshold">{{ equipment_threshold }}</span>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <span data-field="signature_line_1">{{ signature_line_1 }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <span data-field="signature_line_2">{{ signature_line_2 }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 100px;">
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <span data-field="signer_name_1">{{ signer_name_1 }}</span>
      <div style="font-size: small;">EVP, Treasurer and COO</div>
      <div style="font-size: small;">Date: <span data-field="date_1">{{ date_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
      <span data-field="signer_name_2">{{ signer_name_2 }}</span>
      <div style="font-size: small;">Director, Cost Allocation Services</div>
      <div style="font-size: small;">Date: <span data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: right;">
    <div style="font-size: small;">HRS REPRESENTATIVE: <span data-field="hrs_rep_name">{{ hrs_rep_name }}</span></div>
    <div style="font-size: small;">Telephone: <span data-field="hrs_rep_phone">{{ hrs_rep_phone }}</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>